{"id":"nin_era","lemma":"niñera","pos":"noun","rank":2091,"glosses":["babysitter (female)","car hauler (truck)"],"ipa":"/niˈɲeɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"niñeras","masculine":"niñero","masculinePlural":"niñeros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-ni%C3%B1era.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenemos que encontrar una nueva niñera.","en":"We've got to find a new babysitter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586589","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"news, novelty"},null]},{"text":"No soy tu niñera.","en":"I'm not your nanny.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"He tenido suerte de encontrar una buena niñera.","en":"I was lucky that I was able to find a good babysitter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531812","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"luck, fortune"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]},{"text":"Me han dicho que estás buscando una niñera.","en":"I've been told you're looking for a sitter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/871959","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"saying, expression"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to seek","l":"buscar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella no tiene niñera, así que no puede ir a la fiesta.","en":"She doesn't have a babysitter, so she can't go to the party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733732","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"party"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"so, therefore"]]}]}